                                <li><i class="mdi mdi-check-circle-outline text-success me-2"></i> Confirm Member ID, Amount, and Account Types match the intended instruction.</li>
                                <li><i class="mdi mdi-alert-circle-outline text-warning me-2"></i> Review Start/End dates carefully before activating recurring execution.</li>
                                <li><i class="mdi mdi-shield-check-outline text-success me-2"></i> All changes should be logged and auditable.</li>
                            </ul>
